              "snapshot_sha256": "ff589967d9e74baba83c9a0e3a352555f0d763b360db6db89bddda3425aecc33",
              "quote": "Last updated: September 1, 2026\nOura Membership gives you deeper access to accurate data and information about your body, allowing you to make more informed decisions and lead a healthier life. For new members, your first month of membership comes with your ring purchase.\nOura Membership and Oura Ring work hand-in-hand, empowering you to prioritize your long-term health goals and build healthy habits that will last a lifetime. With an active membership, you can track numerous biometrics and receive personalized insights from Oura to help you understand what your body needs.\nOura Membership only applies to Gen3 and newer."
            },
            {
              "source_id": "RING-01",
              "chunk_id": "RING-01-C2",
              "line_start": 57,
              "line_end": 59,
              "snapshot_sha256": "ff589967d9e74baba83c9a0e3a352555f0d763b360db6db89bddda3425aecc33",
              "quote": "How Much Does Oura Membership Cost?\nOura Membership is available for $5.99/month and $69.99/year in the US, and 5.99 €/month and 69.99 €/year in the European Union. All other membership pricing varies by region and currency. Any applicable taxes are calculated based on your local tax laws and regulations. You can see country-specific pricing in Membership Hub.\nNew members receive one included month of Oura Membership. Oura Membership is tied to your Oura account, not your physical Oura Ring. If you purchase an additional ring with an existing Oura account, you will not receive another complimentary month of Oura Membership."
            }
          ],
